<h2>Welcome to Farm, {{displayName}}!</h2>
<p>Your account has been created successfully.</p>
<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 16px 0;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #666;">Username</td>
    <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: 600;">{{username}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #666;">Email</td>
    <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: 600;">{{email}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #666;">Role</td>
    <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: 600;">{{role}}</td>
  </tr>
</table>
<p>You can now log in and start exploring the developer portal.</p>
